    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Had">Had.</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Áá sceal mid rihte dóm æfter dǽde 7 medemung be mæðe for Gode 7 for worlde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">There must always by rights be sentence according to the degree, in ecclesiastical and secular concerns.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 A man sceal mid rihte dom æfter dæde 7 medemung be mæþe for Gode 7 for worulde.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">One must always pass a judgement appropriate for the deed and set a penalty appropriate for the rank in matters divine and secular.</ab>
      </div>
